= Matched native monic runner
Prime-field source construction · 2026-11-03

The runner joins baseline, monic candidate and A/A in one executable with a shared meter. Seven candidate modules have checked reversible transformations. Three hooks cover new monic arithmetic; existing baseline instrumentation is unchanged.

#image("pipeline.svg", width: 100%)

== Software validation
The optimized native runner compiled successfully. Source mapping checks recover all seven original modules byte-for-byte. The description mode runs without cryptographic work. A review corrected fixture-index parity to the draft's target parity before any panel execution; both build logs are retained.

== Output contract
Six setup/preparation records precede 24 query records over eight fixed public fixtures. Snapshots precede output formatting. Query and independent verification retain separate stages. All counter dimensions are emitted, with names in the header. Failed recovery or scalar mismatch remains a row and causes a failing process exit. Scalar labels remain outside the recovery API.

== Next dependency
Strict panel analysis, binary/protocol binding, preflight and authoritative EKS admission must precede the frozen comparison. No comparison data or timing was collected. The original 4563-case cohort remains unchanged.

